  "body": "# Relay\n\nRelay forwards webhook events to internal consumers. It listens on port 8080 by default.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Install the `relay` binary.\n2. Set `RELAY_TOKEN`.\n3. Run `relay serve`.\n\n## Retries\n\nFailed deliveries are retried 3 times with a fixed 5 second delay.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A[Webhook] --> B[Relay]\n```\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
